There are only a few left but the

261
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:45,837
question is whose lives do they contain?

262
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:52,660
What happened it's like something just
stabbed me what the hell happened!

263
00:19:00,840 --> 00:19:02,740
No, don't tell me it's him.

264
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:05,420
Ah, you figured it out.

265
00:19:06,840 --> 00:19:09,477
I was having fun. For a moment,

266
00:19:09,560 --> 00:19:13,977
I thought you might cut your own captain
to shreds without realizing it was him.

267
00:19:14,060 --> 00:19:15,520
But that's all right.

268
00:19:15,740 --> 00:19:17,537
Now that you know you can't win,

269
00:19:17,620 --> 00:19:21,180
I'll enjoy watching you fall
deeper and deeper into despair.

270
00:19:22,320 --> 00:19:25,379
Your vow to defeat me has
been rendered meaningless.

271
00:19:26,020 --> 00:19:29,477
You can only strike me down by
killing your beloved partner.

272
00:19:29,560 --> 00:19:32,720
You bastard! Master! Master!

273
00:19:39,720 --> 00:19:42,080
It tickles my imagination,

274
00:19:42,580 --> 00:19:47,560
thinking of all the uncertainty and
suffering you're hiding behind that mask.

275
00:19:48,660 --> 00:19:49,720
I'm ready.

276
00:19:50,220 --> 00:19:51,160
Entertain me.

277
00:19:51,600 --> 00:19:52,860
Kill me if you dare.

278
00:19:59,100 --> 00:20:01,180
You are sick!

279
00:20:03,840 --> 00:20:06,440
Out of my way, Trafalgar!

280
00:20:22,640 --> 00:20:26,100
The price of betrayal
is very steep indeed.

281
00:20:28,180 --> 00:20:29,100
That's right.

282
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:33,177
Not even your new Straw Hat pals can
save you from what you've got coming.

283
00:20:33,260 --> 00:20:36,320
It's execution time, and
your rats are getting bad.

284
00:20:36,440 --> 00:20:37,616
He's a friend alive!

285
00:20:47,440 --> 00:20:48,270
Somebody help us!

286
00:20:48,353 --> 00:20:49,535
Where did Markham go?

287
00:20:53,440 --> 00:20:55,205
He reached his physical limit.

288
00:20:57,440 --> 00:20:59,381
We'll have to do this on our own.

289
00:21:08,400 --> 00:21:09,988
Sangoro, are you all right?

290
00:21:10,800 --> 00:21:12,360
Oh, sure, it just tickles.

291
00:21:12,620 --> 00:21:14,257
I can't fight both of them at once.

292
00:21:14,340 --> 00:21:17,752
Do you want us to find Zoro
Judo so he can finish him off?

293
00:21:18,940 --> 00:21:20,720
Pull it together, boss head.

294
00:21:26,240 --> 00:21:28,680
Does it normally take this long to work?

295
00:21:28,940 --> 00:21:31,637
I've never seen it used with
such extensive injuries.

296
00:21:31,720 --> 00:21:33,300
Hey, Chopper! Miyagi!

297
00:21:33,620 --> 00:21:35,857
If the drug's not
working, take Mummy Judo?

298
00:21:35,940 --> 00:21:36,997
And get the hell out of here!

299
00:21:37,080 --> 00:21:41,240
Don't worry, we injected him,
so it should take effect soon.

300
00:21:42,340 --> 00:21:43,617
Keep fighting, Zoro!

301
00:21:43,700 --> 00:21:46,877
Hang on, we have to find
some way to stop those two.

302
00:21:46,960 --> 00:21:50,297
At this rate, they're going to wipe
out everyone on the entire floor!

303
00:21:50,380 --> 00:21:52,677
Find Roro, Noah, Zoro!

304
00:21:52,760 --> 00:21:54,680
Kill him while you still can!

305
00:21:55,300 --> 00:21:56,937
They gave him some strange treatment!

306
00:21:57,020 --> 00:21:59,640
Don't allow him any time to recover.

307
00:22:10,100 --> 00:22:12,260
You shouldn't turn your back on me!

308
00:22:15,060 --> 00:22:17,060
You got this, Scar!

309
00:22:20,360 --> 00:22:22,380
Real cute, you punk!

310
00:22:24,120 --> 00:22:27,340
I'm not gonna let you
bastards cut down anyone else!

311
00:22:33,200 --> 00:22:34,141
Dimwitted Dance.

312
00:22:37,580 --> 00:22:40,940
You kicked up so much
dust I can barely see!

313
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:47,360
I'm gonna lickety-stickety
you, Vinsmoke Sanji.

314
00:22:47,780 --> 00:22:49,320
This is personal.

315
00:22:50,220 --> 00:22:53,100
If you had Merry Pudding
like Mama planned,

316
00:22:53,280 --> 00:22:57,045
we wouldn't be here right now
teaming up with a bunch of idiots!

317
00:23:03,920 --> 00:23:05,717
That's him, master?

318
00:23:05,800 --> 00:23:08,160
I see.

319
00:23:11,600 --> 00:23:15,860
Go to hell, worthless jammer scum!

320
00:23:18,020 --> 00:23:21,780
Let's take this outside, shall we?

321
00:23:27,240 --> 00:23:29,520
I'm here to avenge Pedro!

322
00:23:41,980 --> 00:23:43,400
There is no escape.

323
00:23:43,880 --> 00:23:44,920
I found Dorry!

324
00:23:45,280 --> 00:23:46,640
Everyone follow me!

325
00:23:47,140 --> 00:23:48,660
Let's butcher him!

326
00:23:51,660 --> 00:23:53,500
The Beast Pilate!

327
00:23:54,540 --> 00:23:58,680
Zoro Juno fought for Wado, so
we'll fight to protect him. Yeah!

328
00:23:59,620 --> 00:24:01,385
Those samurai are all wounded!

329
00:24:01,580 --> 00:24:04,417
We can finish them off at
the same time as Rhino!

330
00:24:04,500 --> 00:24:06,080
We'd better follow them!

331
00:24:06,340 --> 00:24:09,037
We still don't know what's
going to happen to Zoro!

332
00:24:09,120 --> 00:24:09,950
We got it!

333
00:24:36,120 --> 00:24:38,820
Oh, King Pluton!

334
00:25:02,240 --> 00:25:05,680
You're really making me work
today, aren't you, Mosshead?

335
00:25:11,420 --> 00:25:13,880
Better get out of our way, Blackleg!

336
00:25:24,260 --> 00:25:25,320
It's over!

337
00:25:27,120 --> 00:25:28,700
It's pure your plan!

338
00:25:29,300 --> 00:25:30,680
A dying thistle!

339
00:25:42,040 --> 00:25:46,060
I heard a story about this long ago.

340
00:25:46,900 --> 00:25:48,857
On top of the Great Red Wall,

341
00:25:48,940 --> 00:25:52,660
It dwelled a race of people
who've been burst into flames.

342
00:25:53,200 --> 00:25:54,560
King the wildfire.

343
00:25:54,920 --> 00:25:56,220
I get it now.

344
00:25:58,300 --> 00:26:01,000
I didn't expect to see you alive.

345
00:26:02,000 --> 00:26:02,830
Marco!

346
00:26:03,280 --> 00:26:05,398
The white deer pirates off the roof!

347
00:26:05,580 --> 00:26:06,521
Give up already!

348
00:26:07,540 --> 00:26:08,370
Fine.

349
00:26:08,980 --> 00:26:10,120
I surrender.

350
00:26:13,140 --> 00:26:14,920
I'm satisfied now.

351
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:17,711
I've hogged the spotlight for long enough.

352
00:26:31,460 --> 00:26:34,636
And now it's time for the
real star to take the stage.

353
00:26:59,380 --> 00:27:00,780
Roronoa!

354
00:27:03,780 --> 00:27:05,097
Roronoa!

355
00:27:05,180 --> 00:27:06,260
Diably!

356
00:27:07,280 --> 00:27:09,060
Three-sword style.

357
00:27:10,580 --> 00:27:11,980
Purgatory!

358
00:27:19,940 --> 00:27:21,260
You need to get me!

359
00:27:47,540 --> 00:27:50,197
All right, straw hands, where to show us?

360
00:27:50,280 --> 00:27:51,360
That dog!

361
00:27:51,720 --> 00:27:53,980
It's a miracle!

362
00:27:55,640 --> 00:27:58,380
Yeah, but I'm worried about later.

363
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:01,520
Hey, Curly Browns.

364
00:28:02,320 --> 00:28:05,380
You know what happens if
we win this battle, right?

365
00:28:05,820 --> 00:28:08,680
We'll cross the threshold
into the final stretch

366
00:28:09,440 --> 00:28:14,500
and get a glimpse of Luffy
becoming King of the Pirates.
